# Project: tickets
A ticketing system for events built as a microservice application.
## Architecture
Java 17
Spring Boot 3.3
Kafka 7.x
Keycloak 26.2
PostgreSQL 16.1
Spring Security 6
Spring Kafka 3.3
Confluent Kafka 7.4.0
Keycloak — user authorization and authentication (via Docker)
PostgreSQL — for Keycloak needs
PostgreSQL — local user and ticket database
PostgreSQL — local user, event, and room database
Spring Boot microservices:
- `api-gateway` — routing, security (JWT)
- `ticket-service` — ticket logic
- `event-service` — event and room logic
- `cashier-service`
- `notification-service`
- `scanner-service` 
- Kafka — used for event architecture (sale, cancellation, notifications)
- Vue frontend — user interface
- Centralized logging
## Ports
Keycloak 9090
PostgreSQL for keycloak 5543
API Gateway 8088
Ticket Service 8091
Event Service 8092
PostgreSQL for Ticket Service 5432
PostgreSQL for Event Service 5532
Vue frontend 5173
